  "title": "Garlic-Brown Sugar Chicken Breasts",
  "description": "Sweet brown sugar and flavorful garlic combine to create a delicious sauce for these easy baked chicken breasts your family will love.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
